        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Lost in Space (American Dad!) episode, La La Land (Wax Fang album)\n- Organizations: Fox, Animation Domination\n- Topics: airing schedules, songs\n\nFacts:\n- Animation Domination was a Fox lineup block that aired on Sunday evenings through that night’s entire primetime schedule unless it was preempted, usually by sports telecasts.\n- The American Dad! episode \"Lost in Space\" aired on May 5, 2013, on Fox’s Animation Domination lineup.\n- The Wax Fang album La La Land included a song entitled \"Lost In Space\" in 2013.",
